      "kind": "note",
      "x": 1856,
      "y": 640,
      "w": 352,
      "h": 240,
      "label": "",
      "props": {
        "text": "Sized for the 2x burst with one zone lost (see Estimation). Writes go to 3 ingesters, one per zone, and need 2 acknowledgements; Run mode sends each request to one zone, so the per-zone ingester load it shows is lower than the real one. Rulers query ingester memory directly and are not on any client path. Run mode sends both request types from both clients by user count, so some reads enter through the ingest LB."
      }
